1
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,720
You still remember Wei Xiaodong, right?

2
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:02,840
Wei Xiaodong.

3
00:01:13,039 --> 00:01:14,880
This child died too tragically.

4
00:01:15,039 --> 00:01:16,680
I looked into the case from back then.

5
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,539
Because of the Wei Xiaodong case,

6
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,700
you suffered a lot.

7
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:22,320
Wei Xiaodong, male, 12 years old.

8
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:24,920
He had multiple bruises on his body from being beaten.

9
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,840
There were two parallel stab wounds on his abdomen

10
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:28,880
with opposite blade surfaces.

11
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:31,520
It was suspected that the deceased suffered abuse before death.

12
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,800
During the struggle,

13
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:34,720
the victim was stabbed by the killer,

14
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:35,850
resulting in death.

15
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,759
Moreover, the victim's lower body was severely torn.

16
00:01:37,759 --> 00:01:39,479
It's possible they were tortured and killed by a pedophile,

17
00:01:39,479 --> 00:01:40,200
then dumped.

18
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:40,600
Chief,

19
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:43,039
I request to open an investigation immediately.

20
00:01:43,039 --> 00:01:45,570
The nature of this case is extremely heinous.

21
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,520
We must investigate it thoroughly

22
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:48,680
and catch the real killer.

23
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,280
Sir.

24
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,360
Chief.

25
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:53,600
The victim was found in our jurisdiction.

26
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:55,280
I request to participate in the investigation.

27
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,080
Detective Li,

28
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:58,080
I think you just want to steal the credit.

29
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:58,920
You two

30
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,280
are only good for catching thieves.

31
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,920
You can't solve this case without me.

32
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,280
You!

33
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:03,840
Chengrui,

34
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:04,520
Jinwen,

35
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,120
you two

36
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,760
will assist Jiang Siyao.

37
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,479
Yes, sir.

38
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,160
Wei Xiaodong is an orphan.

39
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:14,640
He was previously adopted by a rickshaw puller, Li Youcai.

40
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:16,240
Now, as long as we find Li Youcai,

41
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,079
we will have clues.

42
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:17,960
Got it.

43
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,200
Enemies really do cross paths.

44
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,360
You're a step late.

45
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:25,440
Reaction speed is also an ability.

46
00:02:26,079 --> 00:02:26,880
Take him away.

47
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:32,120
Li Chengrui has been a police officer for ten years longer than you.

48
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,450
It's natural that he has more experience.

49
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,820
Don't be discouraged.

50
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:37,120
You take it well.

51
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:37,770
Officer.

52
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,520
I did adopt Xiaodong.

53
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,320
But this child,

54
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:43,760
he didn't have enough to eat or wear with me.

55
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:45,520
He ran away on his own in less than two months.

56
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,480
Li Youcai.

57
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:49,880
We've already checked your background.

58
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,720
At your age,

59
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:52,560
you don't have a wife,

60
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,760
and can't even feed yourself.

61
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,290
Why would you raise a child?

62
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,120
Speak.

63
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:57,840
Have you been a bachelor for so long

64
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,700
that you've become a psychopath?

65
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:00,680
Officer.

66
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,000
I swear to God.

67
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:04,840
I just wanted to adopt a child

68
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,480
to look after me in my old age.

69
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,520
But who would have thought this child

70
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,160
would be so heartless?

71
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:11,960
He ran away on his own.

72
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,450
You won't talk, huh?

73
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:15,760
Then we'll have to use torture.

74
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,970
Superintendent Li.

75
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,040
Old Li.

76
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,280
Without conclusive evidence,

77
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:27,079
beating someone indiscriminately,

78
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,900
if it gets to the chief,

79
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:30,970
it won't be easy to explain.

80
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,180
Don't you think so?

81
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:42,930
They're out.

82
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,160
You three

83
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:48,800
and Li Youcai are all from the rickshaw company.

84
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,520
We can prove

85
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:51,240
that Xiaodong ran away two months ago.

86
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,040
Yes, officer.

87
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:54,200
Youcai is really an honest man.

88
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:54,920
For so many years,

89
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,600
he has never quarreled with anyone.

90
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:57,240
That's right.

91
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,440
He lives with us.

92
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,120
He couldn't possibly do such a thing.

93
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:00,560
Yeah.

94
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,560
Do you know

95
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,720
after Wei Xiaodong ran away,

96
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:03,520
where he went?

97
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:06,040
We are not quite sure about that.

98
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:06,800
You three,

99
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,000
please go and ask around too.

100
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,840
Come to us anytime if you have any clues.

101
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,600
Deputy Director,

102
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,640
I request the immediate release of Li Youcai.

103
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,680
He couldn't possibly be the murderer.

104
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:17,000
How do you know Li Youcai is not the real murderer?

105
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,079
All the rickshaw pullers at the company

106
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:21,519
can prove that what Li Youcai said is true.

107
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:24,080
How do you know they are not accomplices

108
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,480
or just covering for him?

109
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,120
When Wei Xiaodong was found,

110
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,240
apart from the scars,

111
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,240
he was very clean.

112
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,280
He couldn't possibly have died in such a dirty place as the rickshaw company.

113
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,040
All right.

114
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,240
Release Li Youcai,

115
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:34,720
and keep investigating.

116
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,280
Yes, sir.

117
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:38,720
What's wrong, Old Xu?

118
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,520
Officer Jiang,

119
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:40,650
we found something.

120
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,400
Found what?

121
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:44,120
Yesterday, we searched the whole city.

122
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,040
A street vendor said

123
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:45,680
Xiaodong

124
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,640
was taken away by

125
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,280
a slightly older boy.

126
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,000
What boy?

127
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:51,520
About 15 or 16 years old,

128
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:52,400
tall and thin.

129
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:54,960
The vendor didn't see his face clearly.

130
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,010
Later, we asked around privately.

131
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:59,000
A fisherman by the Haihe River said

132
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,800
there's a teenager named Hu Agen

133
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,200
living alone by the river.

134
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,320
A couple of days ago,

135
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,520
a boy stayed with him.

136
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,160
Okay, got it.

137
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,620
You guys go back first.

138
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,480
What are you doing?

139
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:14,840
What's your name?

140
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:15,520
Agen.

141
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:16,120
Full name.

142
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,120
Hu Agen.

143
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:18,840
I...

144
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,460
I didn't break the law.

145
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,080
You...

146
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,300
What are you doing?

147
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:26,820
Take a look.

148
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:31,640
This dagger of yours,

149
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:32,680
its blade perfectly matches

150
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,440
the wounds on Wei Xiaodong's body.

151
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:35,970
What else do you have to say?

152
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,080
I don't even know what you're talking about.

153
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:39,000
A few days ago,

154
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,400
a 12-year-old boy

155
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,400
was staying at your house.

156
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,260
Who is he to you?

157
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,120
A friend.

158
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,480
What kind of friend?

159
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,280
Just a friend

160
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:48,360
I met by chance who shares my interests.

161
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:49,440
But officer,

162
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,320
I really don't know his name.

163
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:55,360
More like shared sexual interests.

164
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:56,450
What do you mean?

165
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,240
Hu Agen.

166
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,159
The evidence is conclusive.

167
00:05:59,159 --> 00:06:00,320
You killed Wei Xiaodong.

168
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,640
What else is there to deny?

169
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:02,200
I didn't.

170
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:03,720
You're talking nonsense.

171
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,200
Shut up.

172
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,640
How dare you still deny it.

173
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:06,370
Torture him.

174
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:07,640
Wait a minute.

175
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,570
Come out with me.

176
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,240
Get out. It wasn't me. You...

177
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,120
Do you have any idea

178
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,180
what you are doing?

179
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,480
I know exactly what I'm doing.

180
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,440
It's none of your business.

181
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,320
I know you hate this kind of crime,

182
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,840
but until the evidence comes out,

183
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,760
we can't determine if he's the killer.

184
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:25,360
Why are you acting like Li Chengrui?

185
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,920
The murder weapon has been found.

186
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,520
We have both witnesses and material evidence.

187
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,320
Lin Jinwen.

188
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:30,760
What exactly do you know,

189
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,680
or who are you protecting?

190
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,640
I don't know anything,

191
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,720
nor am I protecting anyone.

192
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:36,040
I just don't want you to insult him like this.

193
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:36,600
You...

194
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:43,240
I was wrong about yesterday.

195
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:44,380
I apologize to you.

196
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,800
Using torture during interrogation,

197
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,080
isn't that normal?

198
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:50,120
That was normal procedure.

199
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:51,680
Did you have to get so mad?

200
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,880
I just went to check.

201
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:55,159
The person who stayed at Hu Agen's place a couple of days ago

202
00:06:55,159 --> 00:06:56,690
wasn't Wei Xiaodong at all.

203
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:58,840
Hu Agen was telling the truth.

204
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,040
Officer Lin!

205
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,780
Officer Lin, bad news!

206
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,480
Hu Agen committed suicide in prison.

207
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,440
His parents are carrying his body

208
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:06,520
and making a scene at the police station entrance.

209
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,120
Hurry up.

210
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,560
Jiang Siyao,

211
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:11,960
come out here!

212
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:14,240
Give me back my son!

213
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,900
People like her don't deserve to be cops.

214
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,320
A murderer with no regard for human life!

215
00:07:18,320 --> 00:07:20,050
She's the one who killed my son!

216
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:21,720
Tell Jiang Siyao to come out right now!

217
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,440
Folks, please calm down.

218
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:26,080
Tell her to come out!

219
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:27,410
Everyone, listen to me.

220
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:30,720
Right, making a rash judgment based on a single weapon.

221
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,760
Some top female detective of Fenghuang Street.

222
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:33,560
If you ask me,

223
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,920
she's the top female psycho of Fenghuang Street.

224
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:38,120
Did my son die for nothing?

225
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,280
Li Chengrui,

226
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:41,760
you better watch your mouth.

227
00:07:43,159 --> 00:07:44,360
Am I wrong?

228
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:47,120
If she hadn't tried to be smart with this case,

229
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,640
would it have come to this?

230
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,650
Why are you protecting her so much?

231
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:51,560
Could it be

232
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:53,760
you want to be a live-in son-in-law at the Jiang Mansion?

233
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,220
Say that again if you dare.

234
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,360
Calm down.

235
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:00,880
Chief.

236
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,160
It's my fault.

237
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:04,020
I'll resign to take the blame.

238
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,360
Ayao.

239
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,240
I brought you into this profession,

240
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,840
and you are my last student.

241
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,520
I understand how you feel.

242
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:18,720
But,

243
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:21,080
you can't act on impulse.

244
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,650
I didn't expect it to end like this.

245
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:25,380
I've read the file.

246
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:28,020
You followed the procedure completely.

247
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:30,010
Why did Hu Agen commit suicide?

248
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:31,720
Don't you want to know?

249
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:34,840
Who exactly killed Wei Xiaodong?

250
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,760
Don't you want to know?

251
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,080
Sir.

252
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,730
After three days of detention,

253
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,240
if there was no evidence,

254
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:45,320
we would have let Hu Agen go.

255
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:47,160
Why couldn't he even hold on

256
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:49,040
for one day before committing suicide?

257
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:51,040
There's still a lot you can do.

258
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:53,160
I hope you can pull yourself together,

259
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:54,480
find out the truth,

260
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:56,160
instead of running away.

261
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,640
So...

262
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:00,380
The case from back then

263
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:01,400
was never closed.

264
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:03,360
Just like what Senior Song and I found out

265
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,560
about the banned drug, Seven-Colored Krait,

266
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:06,640
this case

267
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:08,100
came to an abrupt end here.

268
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,480
The Seven-Colored Krait case,

269
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,640
the Wei Xiaodong case,

270
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,440
and the Jingxiang Society case.

271
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,320
Between all of these,

272
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,560
what exactly is the connection?

273
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,520
Don't you think

274
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,600
the clues provided by this mysterious person

275
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,040
are pointing to something specific?

276
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,400
In the pile of bones in the suburbs of the capital,

277
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,440
the banned drug Seven-Colored Krait was found.

278
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,280
Peter used the Seven-Colored Krait drug

279
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:27,940
to rape and murder young boys.

280
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,520
Then the missing girls

281
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:32,040
were locked up and indoctrinated by the Jingxiang Society.

282
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,560
The master of the Jingxiang Society

283
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:36,280
is Lin Yousheng, who killed John years ago.

284
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:39,160
John and Peter were both members of the church.

285
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:42,000
It seems like everything goes around in circles

286
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,680
and comes back to the starting point.

287
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:44,760
Such a serious case

288
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,920
hasn't been solved for over a decade

289
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,680
because every time it reaches a critical point,

290
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,520
it encounters strong resistance.

291
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,680
Now the whole city

292
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,320
is paying attention to this case.

293
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,720
The mysterious person probably wants to

294
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:55,780
use this attention

295
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,720
to create huge public pressure,

296
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:58,720
so that this case

297
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,780
can't be easily suppressed anymore.

298
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:01,640
Perhaps,

299
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:05,020
the Jingxiang Society is a crucial step in his plan.

300
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,040
Boss.

301
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,560
Damn it.

302
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:14,320
How is he?

303
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,440
He's dead.

304
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:21,520
Things were just getting clear.

305
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:22,720
Now it's a mess again.

306
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,600
Who do you think

307
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:25,160
killed the boss?

308
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,520
Someone who doesn't want us to solve the case.

309
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:28,120
It seems

310
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,880
he wants to cut off this clue.

311
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:37,160
Another life lost.

312
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,760
Superintendent Li,

313
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:40,760
you always show up right on time.

314
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:41,920
Sorry.

315
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,560
I'm a step late again.

316
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:45,440
Reporters,

317
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,600
the Jingxiang Society incident

318
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,640
is credited to our Phoenix Police Department.

319
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,640
But this case

320
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:51,720
is not over yet,

321
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:54,120
because the mastermind has not been found.

322
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,760
We will do our best

323
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,160
to find the real culprit.

324
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,120
Inspector Jiang,

325
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,800
do you mean

326
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:00,680
Venerable Jiaohua is not the main culprit,

327
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,120
and the killer is someone else?

328
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,520
Inspector Jiang, please tell us more.

329
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:05,320
I have one more thing to announce.

330
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,760
I formally apologize to the victims

331
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:07,840
of the Wei Xiaodong case.

332
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,160
It has remained unsolved for five years

333
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:10,480
due to my

334
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:11,840
dereliction of duty.

335
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,520
Through our investigation,

336
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:16,240
the pile of bones case in the capital suburbs,

337
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:19,120
the smuggling case of Peter, a church doctor in the British Concession,

338
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,680
the rape and murder of a young boy,

339
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:22,760
and the abduction of women by the Jingxiang Society

340
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:25,280
are all related to the incident five years ago.

341
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,200
I announce that

342
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,320
starting today,

343
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:31,290
the investigation into the Wei Xiaodong case will be reopened.

344
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:35,120
There is not a single wound on the deceased's body.

345
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,800
But from the deceased's stomach,

346
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:38,730
potassium cyanide was extracted.

347
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,610
Potassium cyanide.

348
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:43,320
If he really is from the Jingxiang Society,

349
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,680
then the clue he provided us

350
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:45,940
about the police shoes

351
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:48,520
was just to mislead our investigation.

352
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,640
But,

353
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:51,160
as for the master of the Jingxiang Society,

354
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:52,880
we have no clues at all right now.

355
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,440
This organization, the Jingxiang Society,

356
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,500
is far from simple.

357
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:56,880
It seems

358
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,960
someone is watching us all the time.

359
00:11:59,480 --> 00:11:59,880
No.

360
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,280
Come here and take a look.

361
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:01,680
Look,

362
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:03,800
this tattoo

363
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,320
was done recently.
